<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Northern Gold raises gold resources.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Northern Gold raises gold resources.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miner Northern Gold NL said on Friday it had raised its total resources estimate 120 percent to 1.127 million contained ounces.</p>
</text>
